{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Game Introduction]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Ella Stars \u2013 Conquer the Stage with Rhythm!</strong><br>No sense of rhythm? No problem!<br>In <strong>Ella Stars</strong>, join <strong>Ella</strong> and <strong>Bird</strong> as they fight against villains threatening the music world!<br>Dodge the boss\u2019s powerful attacks and strike back with thrilling rhythmic action!<br>A music action game that feels like an animated adventure \u2013 are you ready to take the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/extras/250305_\uc2a4\ud300_\uc18c\uac1c_\uc774\ubbf8\uc9c0_\uce90\ub9ad\ud130\uc2a4\ud0a8.gif?t=1744585500\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Game Features]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>A Variety of Music Styles</strong><br>From <strong>Glam Rock</strong> to <strong>Lo-fi Hip Hop</strong>, enjoy a soundtrack that keeps your ears entertained!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>A Perfect Blend of Rhythm and Action</strong><br>Hit the beats, land powerful attacks, and defeat your enemies in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Exciting Fever Time!</strong><br>Unleash Ella and Bird\u2019s explosive skills to dominate the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Special Costumes &amp; Unique Action Effects!</strong><br>Unlock different versions of Ella with fun and stylish costume collections!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Vibrant &amp; Dynamic Stage Backgrounds</strong><br>Immerse yourself in ever-changing, trendy visuals as you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Choose Your Difficulty!</strong><br>With <strong>Easy - Normal - Crazy Mode</strong>, everyone can enjoy a rhythm challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Ensembles of Boss Battles!</strong><br>Time your attacks right to weaken the boss and turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Create Your Own Beats!</strong><br>Use <strong>Creator Mode</strong> to make custom note patterns and play to your own rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce2 <strong>Feel the rhythm in Ella Stars \u2013 Play now!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401870?t=1744585500","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/53093c9a1ad003d3e1b82bdc073c0c446a9da0d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744585500","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/96b6a879b42a2930447ff457ba164a5a0de47093/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744585500","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401870/96b6a879b42a2930447ff457ba164a5a0de47093/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744585500","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3418980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[Game Introduction]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Ella Stars \u2013 Conquer the Stage with Rhythm!</strong><br>No sense of rhythm? No problem!<br>In <strong>Ella Stars</strong>, join <strong>Ella</strong> and <strong>Bird</strong> as they fight against villains threatening the music world!<br>Dodge the boss\u2019s powerful attacks and strike back with thrilling rhythmic action!<br>A music action game that feels like an animated